          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, natural gas, at CHP power plant
Translated name: Strom, ab Erdgas-WKK-Kraftwerk
Included processes: Electricity output at busbar. The dataset uses the average net efficiency of power plants in the region adjusted for co-generation (using allocation based on exergy content). 

The average allocated net electrical efficiency is about 40.3 %. The electricity generation of this technology in the region is at about 400 GWh based on international energy statistics.

Technology: Average technology mix.

